<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?><Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet" xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet">
    <Worksheet ss:Name="Dialogue">
      <Table>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">ID</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">zho</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Comments</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Localized texts</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_Vlad_intro1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">欢迎来到越南！要不惜一切代价冲入敌人基地，&#10;释放被关押的囚犯！虽然很危险，&#10;但希望你不要放过任何弹药仓库&#10;还有无线电塔，总之炸光所有敌方设施。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The blue lines are recorded with "gibberish" language.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Welcome to ‘nam! You are to recklessly fight your way into the enemy base, and free the prisoners there! And if that wasn’t dangerous enough for you, I also want you to blow up any ammo caches and radio towers you come across.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_Vlad_intro2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这里太阳真火辣，作为一名吸血鬼我感到压力很大！&#10;所以我不能像之前那样一路陪着你，让我们在汇合点相聚。&#10;祝你好运！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">The sun here is giving me a nasty burn, so I mustn’t linger. See you at the rendezvous!   Good luck!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_Vlad_napalm</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">&gt;我已经给了你请求空中支援的权限，只需甩出一颗烟雾弹来定位，&#10;熊熊烈火就会神奇地从天而降！很带感的！[p=1.5]&#10;玻璃咿咿咿！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Vlad is explaining about summoning napalm. You throw a smoke grenade, and then liquid fire rains down from the sky, in the area marked by the smoke. (Vlad calls in a napalm bomber in response to your smoke signal.)  Note that these two lines will have a "radio"/"walkie-talkie" effect. This can effect the actor's performance.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I’ve given you clearance for air support. Just summon a smoke grenade and fire will magickally fall from the sky on that position! Bleeeigh.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_Vlad_rendevouz</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">什么？你已经在汇合点了！？不要害怕，人类朋友！&#10;待在那儿别动，我们很快就到！&#10;玻璃咿咿咿！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Note that these two lines will have a "radio"/"walkie-talkie" effect. This can effect the actor's performance.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">What? You’re already at the rendezvous!? Fear not, fellow humans! Hold your position, and we shall soon be there! Bleigh!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_Vlad_outro</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">快快快！快上直升机！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String"/>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Quickly! Get in the chopper!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_private_comment0</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">噢，我菊花疼的紧！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">blue lines are spoken by NPCs, not in sequence. These are various comments made by soldiers.  not really a quote, just an amusing thing soldiers typically say. (FUBAR (pronounced foo-bar) is a soldier's colloquialism/acronym, meaning "Fucked Up Beyond All Recognition" = very bad.)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This situation is completely FUBAR!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_private_comment1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">伙计，我都忘了我们为什么要这么做了…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">typical anti-Vietnam war sentiment</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Man, I forget why we're even doing this…</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_private_comment2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我应该申请去炊事班值日的…</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">amusing thing that soldiers say</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I should have applied for kitchen duty...</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_private_comment3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">雨林里的路踩起来有种黏答答湿乎乎的感觉。&#10;呃，就是字面意思，&#10;我想可能有只虫子在我靴子里。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This jungle is giving me the creeps. Literally, I think I got bugs in my boots.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">This jungle is giving me the creeps. Literally, I think I got bugs in my boots.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_private_comment4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我们必须拿下这座无线电塔。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We've got to take out this radio tower.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">We've got to take out this radio tower.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_private_comment5</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">好，我们就在这里等待下一道命令，&#10;你继续往前走吧。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">nice one = good job with the battle you just finished.  A NPC soldier congratulates the player(s) for defeating the enemies. Then in a comically cowardly way, they “stay here” (where it’s safe), and send the player(s) on ahead, where there will be more enemies.  you=singular or plural. It's possible to stay singular because each player feels personally addressed. It's a psychological effect.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Nice one, we'll stay here and await further orders. You go on ahead.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rescue0</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">喔噢，非常感谢！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">green lines = prisoner has been rescued</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Woo-hoo, thanks!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rescue1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">多谢，我，我赶紧跑路。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Skedaddle = colloquial for "get out of here"</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Much obliged, I'll just skedaddle then.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rescue2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">哥总算出来了！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I'm outta here!</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I'm outta here!</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rescue3</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">这里真可怕，他们强迫我们玩三国杀！</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Deerhunter reference. (in this film, prisoners are forced to play Russian roulette with each other)</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It's been awful here, they made us play Russian scrabble! </Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rambo0</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">当你被逼至绝境，杀戮会变得如同呼吸般简单。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Quote from Rambo 4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">When you're pushed, killing's as easy as breathing.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rambo1</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">活得平凡不如死得其所。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Quote from Rambo 4</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Live for nothing or die for something.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_pow_rambo2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">我有一条座右铭，&#10;不能为战友而生，但求为战友而死。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Quote from Rambo 2</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">I have a code of honor. You watch my back, I'll watch yours.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_tooltip_objectives</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">任务目标遍布战场各个角落，完成它们从而获得更高的得分。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It’s the game giving the player tips.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Objectives are spread out across these areas, complete the objectives for a higher mission score.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_tooltip_duck</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">装备热武器时注意使用格挡键来躲闪，&#10;躲在掩体后面能更好地避开冷枪暗弹。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It’s the game giving the player tips.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">To duck, press Block while a firearm is equipped. Ducking behind cover can be a real life saver.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_tooltip_huts</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">摧毁被旗子标记的小屋，阻止敌人虐待更多俘虏。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It’s the game giving the player tips.  huts = military huts/barracks</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Destroy Vietcong huts to stop them from spawning more Vietcong soldiers. Huts are marked with flags.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_tooltip_radiotower</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">你必须破坏所有支撑点才能摧毁无线电塔。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It’s the game giving the player tips.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">To take down a radio tower you must damage each foundation point.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
        <Row>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">#VTN_tooltip_ammostorage</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">放把火可以轻松摧毁弹药仓库。</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">It’s the game giving the player tips.</Data>
          </Cell>
          <Cell>
            <Data ss:Type="String">Ammo storages are easily destroyed, especially when using fire.</Data>
          </Cell>
        </Row>
      </Table>
    </Worksheet>
